sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 前端(库详情页/命中测试)
    participant B as BFF KbController/Facade
    participant K as mis-kb
    participant G as KbGraphService
    participant R as RetrieveQueryResolver
    participant A as RagflowAdapter
    participant C as RagflowClient
    participant E as RAGFlow

    Note over U,E: 链路一：开启图谱 + 触发构图（开关打开自动触发一次 + 手动重试）

    U->>B: PUT /libraries/{id}/engine/settings {useKnowledgeGraph:true}
    B->>K: RagSettingsService.save(id, settings)
    K->>K: validate + enforceGraphAvailability（≤2 库上限 + capabilities.graphrag）
    K->>K: 落库 rag_settings_json（useKnowledgeGraph=true, kgBuildStatus=none）
    K->>C: updateLibrarySettings(datasetId, settings)
    C->>E: PUT /datasets/{id} {parser_config.graphrag{use_graphrag:true, method:"light"}}
    E-->>C: code:0
    K-->>B: 生效设置（useKnowledgeGraph=true, kgBuildStatus=none）
    B-->>U: 保存成功（前端提示「图谱构建已排队」）

    U->>B: POST /libraries/{id}/graph/build
    B->>K: KbGraphController.buildGraph(id)
    K->>K: 判权（kb:library:edit + hasLibraryManage）+ kgBuildStatus 非 building
    K->>G: build(id)
    G->>A: buildGraph(ref)
    A->>C: buildGraph(datasetId)
    C->>E: POST /datasets/{id}/index?type=graph
    E-->>C: {"task_id":"..."}
    G->>K: 回写 kgBuildStatus=building + taskId（落库）
    K-->>B: GraphBuildResultVO{building, taskId}
    B-->>U: 构建中徽标

    Note over U,E: 链路二：状态轮询回写（前端 3s 轮询）

    U->>B: GET /libraries/{id}/graph/build-status
    B->>K: KbGraphController.graphStatus(id)
    K->>G: refreshStatus(id)
    G->>A: queryGraphBuildStatus(ref)
    A->>C: GET /datasets/{id}/index?type=graph
    C-->>A: {progress: 1.0, progress_msg, task_type:"graphrag"}
    A-->>G: GraphBuildSnapshot{READY, progress 1.0}
    G->>K: 回写 kgBuildStatus=ready（progress=-1 → failed + kgBuildMessage）
    K-->>B: KbGraphStatusVO{ready, taskId, updatedAt}
    B-->>U: 徽标翻转「图谱已就绪」

    Note over U,E: 链路三：命中测试/问答检索带图谱增强（use_kg）

    U->>B: POST /hit-test {libraryId, question, enableGraph:true, documentIds:[...]}
    B->>K: KbHitTestService.run(request, userId)
    K->>K: ACL 校验（KbVisibilityService.hasPermission READ）
    K->>R: resolveAll(ctx{useKnowledgeGraph:true, documentIds})
    R->>R: S4.5 降级（capabilities.graphrag / 单库 / kgBuildStatus==ready）
    R-->>K: RetrieveQuery{useKnowledgeGraph:true, documentIds}
    K->>A: retrieve(query)
    alt useKnowledgeGraph=true 且单库且图就绪
        A->>C: searchDataset(datasetId, query, nativeDocIds)
        C->>E: POST /datasets/{id}/search {use_kg:true, doc_ids:[...], size, similarity_threshold}
        E-->>C: chunks[]（KG 结果插入首位）
        C-->>A: List~RfSearchChunk~（content_with_weight 剥离标记）
        A-->>K: List~ChunkHit~（映射 docnm_kwd→docTitle）
    else 多库 / 图未就绪 / 引擎不支持
        A->>C: retrieve(query)（现状 /api/v1/retrieval，零回归）
        C->>E: POST /api/v1/retrieval {question, dataset_ids, page_size, ...}
        E-->>A: chunks[]
        A-->>K: List~ChunkHit~
    end
    K-->>B: HitTestResultVO{hits, effectiveParams(含 useKnowledgeGraph 实际生效 + 降级原因)}
    B-->>U: 结果列表 + 生效参数回显（graph on/off 对比）
